<title>USA: Pricellular names COO Steven Price CEO.</title>
<headline>Pricellular names COO Steven Price CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pricellular Corp on Friday said chief operating officer Steven Price has been named president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The company said current chief executive officer Robert Price will become chairman of the board. Robert Price is company founder.</p>
</text>
